{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Boarded Window is a piece of ",["l","家具","furniture"],". It can rotate into daily stock at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]," for 400g."]],["p",["It's also available from the ",["l","家具目录","Furniture Catalogue"]," for 0g."]],["p",["Players who select a ",["l","农场地图","Wilderness farm map"]," during character creation will have one inside their ",["l","农舍","house"]," when the game begins."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.1","1.1"],": Introduced."]]]]]]]}